<title>NAMIBIA: PRESS DIGEST - Namibia - Feb 25.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Namibia - Feb 25.</headline>
<dateline>WINDHOEK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Namibian press on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>THE NAMIBIAN</p>
<p>- Cattle farmers north of Namibia's Veterinary Cordon Fence suffer losses of more than N$14 million a year because of the cattle disease Contagious Bovine Pleuropneumonia.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>ALLGEMEINE ZEITUNG</p>
<p>- President Sam Nujoma will official open the next session of parliament on Tuesday and deliver a state-of-the-nation address.</p>
</text>
